@q 49:23

@q 49:24-28

**Nipah** (fruit bats; first in Malaysia 1998) caused outbreaks in **Kerala** in 2018 and later years. **Bird flu** is avian influenza **H5N1**. **Ebola** is named after the **Ebola River** in DR Congo (1976). **Rinderpest** (cattle plague, viral) was declared **eradicated in 2011**, the second disease after **smallpox** (1980). Foot-and-mouth disease and cowpox are viral; **anthrax** and **black quarter** are bacterial.

